---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="What I can help with · DuBose, M.D." active="help" bookbar={true}>

  <!-- 1 · Intro -->
  <section class="page-title">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>What I can help with</h1>
      <p class="lede">We work on your health, not just your symptoms.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2 · What we work toward -->
  <section class="section band-tint">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <h2>What we work toward</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="steps c3">
        <div class="step-item">
          <div class="icon-chip" style="background:#fff">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 17a5 5 0 1 0 0-10 5 5 0 0 0 0 10zM12 1v3M12 20v3M4.2 4.2l2.1 2.1M17.7 17.7l2.1 2.1M1 12h3M20 12h3M4.2 19.8l2.1-2.1M17.7 6.3l2.1-2.1" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h4>Feel better day to day</h4>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
          <div class="icon-chip" style="background:#fff">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8l-5-5zM14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h6" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h4>Understand your results</h4>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
          <div class="icon-chip" style="background:#fff">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 7l-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17M16 7h6v6" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h4>Improve your numbers</h4>
          <p>Blood pressure, weight, labs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
          <div class="icon-chip" style="background:#fff">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h4>Prevent disease</h4>
          <p>Screenings and vaccines on time.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
          <div class="icon-chip" style="background:#fff">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h4>Keep conditions controlled</h4>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
          <div class="icon-chip" style="background:#fff">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 12.8A9 9 0 1 1 11.2 3a7 7 0 0 0 9.8 9.8z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h4>Sleep, fitness, nutrition</h4>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3 · Common situations -->
  <section class="section band-warm">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <h2>Common situations</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="cards c3">
        <div class="card">
          <h4>&ldquo;It&rsquo;s several things at once.&rdquo;</h4>
          <p>
            Blood pressure, weight, sleep, stress. Each one manageable,
            together overwhelming. We sort out what&rsquo;s urgent, what
            matters most, and what can wait. Then we work through it in
            order.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h4>&ldquo;Something came back abnormal.&rdquo;</h4>
          <p>
            A lab result or scan you want to understand. I go through it
            with you: what it means, what to do next, and what to watch.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h4>&ldquo;I want my conditions closely managed.&rdquo;</h4>
          <p>
            Diabetes, blood pressure, cholesterol, thyroid. Medicines
            reviewed, complications watched for, numbers moving where we
            agreed they should.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card span">
          <h4>&ldquo;My health and my life are tangled together.&rdquo;</h4>
          <p>
            Stress affects sleep. Sleep affects eating. Money worry sits
            under it all, and your body keeps score. This is real
            medicine, and I take it seriously. We treat what needs
            treating and work the rest one realistic step at a time. When
            a counselor or financial professional is the right tool, I
            help you find one and stay involved.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4 · Conditions -->
  <section class="section" id="bookbar-after">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <h2>Conditions I treat</h2>
        <p class="lede">Membership covers the full range of adult primary care.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="steps c3">
        <div class="step-item">
          <h4>Ongoing conditions</h4>
          <p>High blood pressure, diabetes and prediabetes, cholesterol,
          thyroid, asthma, acid reflux, gout, migraine, and more.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
          <h4>When you&rsquo;re sick</h4>
          <p>Infections, colds that won&rsquo;t quit, UTIs, rashes,
          stomach trouble, and injuries that don&rsquo;t need an ER.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
          <h4>Prevention &amp; screening</h4>
          <p>Annual reviews, cancer screening on schedule, vaccines
          planned, risk assessment.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
          <h4>Medicines</h4>
          <p>Reviewed as a whole: what&rsquo;s working, what&rsquo;s
          redundant, what&rsquo;s interacting. Refills handled
          promptly.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
          <h4>Mind &amp; mood</h4>
          <p>Depression, anxiety, adult ADHD, stress, burnout, and
          insomnia. Treated within primary care, referred wisely when
          needed.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
          <h4>Lifestyle &amp; habits</h4>
          <p>Sleep, weight (including modern weight-loss medicines where
          appropriate), exercise, nutrition, alcohol, and tobacco.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 5 · What I don't do -->
  <section class="section band-warm">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split">
        <div>
          <h2>What I don&rsquo;t do</h2>
        </div>
        <div>
        <div class="rows" style="margin-top:0">
        <div class="row">
          <b>Emergencies</b>
          <p>Chest pain, stroke signs, severe injury: that is 911 and the
          ER, always. Afterward, I help you make sense of what happened.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <b>Hospital care</b>
          <p>The hospital&rsquo;s doctors run the admission. I stay
          informed and manage your care when you&rsquo;re home.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <b>Specialist-led conditions, alone</b>
          <p>Some conditions need an oncologist or cardiologist leading.
          I refer well, co-manage, and keep the whole picture.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <b>Mental health beyond my safe scope</b>
          <p>Serious psychiatric illness and addiction care beyond
          primary care get honest triage and a warm handoff.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <b>Children</b>
          <p>Adults only (18+).</p>
        </div>
      </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 6 · CTA -->
  <section class="section cta-band">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="inner">
        <h2>Not sure if your situation fits?</h2>
        <a class="btn btn-inverse" href="/book">Book a free conversation</a>
        <p style="margin-top:22px"><a class="quiet" href="/how-it-works">How the membership works &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
